</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section style="background: var(--dark-2);">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Why Choose <span>Zyron?</span></h2>
    <p>Hum kyun best hain aapke liye</p>
  </div>
  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-box">
      <div class="icon">🚚</div>
      <h3>Fast Delivery</h3>
      <p>2-3 din me pure Pakistan me delivery</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-box">
      <div class="icon">💯</div>
      <h3>100% Original</h3>
      <p>Sirf original aur branded products</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-box">
      <div class="icon">🔄</div>
      <h3>7-Day Return</h3>
      <p>7 din ka easy return policy</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-box">
      <div class="icon">💳</div>
      <h3>Secure Payment</h3>
      <p>COD, Easypaisa, Bank Transfer</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="about-content">
    <div class="about-img">🔌</div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2>About <span>Zyron Mobile</span></h2>
      <p>Zyron Mobile Accessories Pakistan ka trusted online store hai. Hum original chargers aur data cables provide karte hain — Android, iPhone, Type-C aur har device ke liye.</p>
      <p>Hum direct manufacturers se products lete hain, isliye aapko market se sasta aur original saman milta hai.</p>
